# PART A — VICE PRINCIPAL WORKSPACE

## 2. PURPOSE OF THE VICE PRINCIPAL ROLE

The Vice Principal supports academic operations, monitors school performance, coordinates teachers, reviews attendance, tracks student progress, and handles delegated academic approvals.

The Vice Principal must not simply see a copy of the Admin dashboard.

The Vice Principal workspace should emphasize:
- Academic monitoring
- Class and section performance
- Teacher coordination
- Timetable monitoring
- Attendance oversight
- Examination progress
- Student progress and intervention
- Academic reports
- Authorized academic approvals

The Vice Principal must not automatically receive unrestricted access to HR records, detailed financial operations, school-wide configuration, or sensitive administrative functions.

