- View class teachers, assigned subjects, enrolled students, timetable, and available performance summaries.
- Link to the existing Admin-managed class and section records.
- Do not allow unauthorized creation or deletion of school structures.

### Subject Coverage
- Display subjects assigned to classes and teachers.
- Show available syllabus coverage.
- Highlight missing assignments or incomplete configuration.
- Link to the relevant class, subject, or teacher.

### Syllabus Progress
- Represent syllabus progress using topics or chapters only when the data model supports them.
- Support authorized progress updates and review workflows.
- Record the subject, class, teacher, topic, completion status, update date, and notes where applicable.
- Distinguish teacher-reported progress from Vice Principal-reviewed progress.
- Do not fabricate completion data.

### Academic Activities
- Display school academic activities and deadlines.
- Allow authorized creation or editing only if the existing permission model supports these actions.
- Keep activities linked to the correct academic year and applicable classes.

